   "text": "Dispelling Screen\n(Abjuration)\n\nLevel: 5\nRange: 0\nDuration: 5 turns\nCasting Time: 5\nArea of Effect: 15-ft. radius\nSaving Throw: None\n\nThis spell wards the caster and nearby allies with a protective screen against magic removal for 5 turns. For each protected creature, the screen absorbs and negates the next Dispel Magic, Remove Magic, or Breach effect that strikes them, then dissipates. Higher-level magic attacks such as Pierce Shield and Spellstrike strip Dispelling Screen along with other protections without being absorbed by it.",
